WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.400
Meet RivetFlow. Versioned runbooks keep every execution consistent.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Human approvals pause consequential steps. Idempotent transitions and an audit history

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:19.700
make it clear what happened, why it happened, and how to recover.
